      "message": "I captured the log of events:\n    \n[58705.177981 power state 1 \u003d S5, in 0x003f]\n[58705.178826 power state 6 \u003d S5-\u003eS3, in 0x003f]\n[58705.179684 BD: st0]\n[58705.180866 BD st0: att: 704mV det: 0mV]\n[58705.181717 BD: st1]\n[58705.183104 PD:S5-\u003eS3]\n[58705.184361 power state 2 \u003d S3, in 0x003f]\n\nAfter the initial kick, the state machine never ran because we were in the transition state (S5-\u003eS3).",
